	<p>This document outlines the process and requirements for conducting a destination delivery handover for two-wheelers and motorcycles. The handover involves inspecting the vehicle in daylight conditions, verifying the odometer against the load delivery receipt (LR billity), and obtaining a signed condition sign-off.</p>

	<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin-top: 24px;">
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
